<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T STRONG BUY REITERATED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AT&amp;T STRONG BUY REITERATED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Dean Witter reiterated its strong buy rating on AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
<p>-- in a report cited near-term catalysts:  long-distance segment turning around; $9 billion capital budget trimmed by about $1 billion; the company achieving cost reduction objectives.</p>
<p>-- listed a price target of $50 for year-end 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-8/16 to 40-9/16.</p>
</text>
